{b0}] reconstructs Dixon data with intitial guess T2star = 0.\n\
DixonReconstruct[{real, imag}, echo, {b0, t2}] reconstructs Dixon data with \
t2star and B0.\nDixonReconstruct[{real, imag}, echo, {b0, t2, ph0}] \
reconstructs Dixon data with initial phase.\nDixonReconstruct[{real, imag}, \
echo, {b0, t2, ph0, phb}] reconstructs Dixon data with bipolar phase .\n\n\
