can be calculated from the bvecs en bvals using Bmatrix with the bvalues in \
s/mm^2. \\ninit should are the initialization parameters for 2 components \
this is {s0, f, D, Dp} for 3 componentes this is {s0, f1, f2, D, Dp1, \
Dp2}.\\n\\nThe fraction is defined between 0 and 1, the D, Dp, Dp1 and Dp2 is \
