  InformationData[<|
   "ObjectType" -> "Symbol", "Usage" -> 
    "EPGT2Fit[data, {nEcho, detlaTE}, {exitation, refoucs}] fits the t2 based \
on Marty B et.al. Simultaneous muscle water t2 and fat fraction mapping using \
transverse relaxometry with stimulated echo compensation.\nExitation and \
refocus are the RF pulse angles e.g. 90,180. They can also be a range of \
angeles over the slice profile as defined by GetSliceProfile.\n\nThe output \
is in units as defined by the detlaTE, e.g. if detlaTE is in ms the output is \
in ms.\nThe exitation and refocus are defined in Degrees.\n\nOutput is \
{{{T2map,B1Map},{wat, fat, fatMap}, residual},callibration} or \
{{T2map,B1Map},{wat, fat, fatMap}, residual}.\n\nEPGT2Fit[] is based on DOI: \
10.1002/nbm.3459.", 
    "Documentation" -> <|"Local" -> "paclet:QMRITools/ref/EPGT2Fit"|>, 
    "OwnValues" -> None, "UpValues" -> None, "DownValues" -> None, 
